    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CrapShoot is a side-scrolling bullet-hell shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is an easy shooting game with 3 stages and simple controls with only slow and bomb. The bullets are enhanced by acquiring power-up items, but if you get hit, you lose power, and the game is over when all your power is gone. Clear the game again and again to get the highest score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The witch girl straddles a broomstick and heads for a convenience store, but dog feces and vicious wildlife block her way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game that gained popularity on Japanese feature phones is now available to players in a new, slightly powered-up version. In addition to pixel-perfect graphics, the nostalgic raster scrolling gives the game a retro feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251950/extras/564c1f7cc49ea0f7f9574d3c797b14f4.poster.avif?t=1728561609\" width=480 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251950/extras/564c1f7cc49ea0f7f9574d3c797b14f4.webm?t=1728561609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251950/extras/564c1f7cc49ea0f7f9574d3c797b14f4.mp4?t=1728561609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How To Play</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow and Select :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A button, Z key, Enter key, Space key</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bom and Cancel :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >B button, Esc key, X key, B key, Backspace key</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pause:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start button, P key,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toggle Full Screen :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F11 key</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cancel FullScreen :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Esc key</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reset :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select button long press while pausing</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CrapShoot is a side-scrolling bullet-hell shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is an easy shooting game with 3 stages and simple controls with only slow and bomb. The bullets are enhanced by acquiring power-up items, but if you get hit, you lose power, and the game is over when all your power is gone. Clear the game again and again to get the highest score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The witch girl straddles a broomstick and heads for a convenience store, but dog feces and vicious wildlife block her way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game that gained popularity on Japanese feature phones is now available to players in a new, slightly powered-up version. In addition to pixel-perfect graphics, the nostalgic raster scrolling gives the game a retro feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251950/extras/564c1f7cc49ea0f7f9574d3c797b14f4.poster.avif?t=1728561609\" width=480 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251950/extras/564c1f7cc49ea0f7f9574d3c797b14f4.webm?t=1728561609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251950/extras/564c1f7cc49ea0f7f9574d3c797b14f4.mp4?t=1728561609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How To Play</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow and Select :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A button, Z key, Enter key, Space key</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bom and Cancel :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >B button, Esc key, X key, B key, Backspace key</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pause:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start button, P key,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toggle Full Screen :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F11 key</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cancel FullScreen :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Esc key</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reset :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select button long press while pausing</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
